2 CONT 3) Y.A.M. Tengku Tengah Fatima binti al-Marhum Sultan ‘Abdu’l Jalil Ri’ayat Shah [Tengku Raja Irang]. b. after 1701 (d/o Encik Nusamah). m. (first) October 1722, as his second wife, Opu Daeng Parani (k. by a cannon-ball at Kedah, 
2 CONC 1723), second son of Opu Ten-ri Burang Daeng Rilaga. m. (second) Y.M. Sri Paduka Tun Hasan bin Dato’ Bendahara Tun ‘Abdu’l Jamal, Dato’ Bendahara Sri Maharaja (d. before 1770), son of her paternal uncle, Y.M. Sri Paduka Tun ‘Abdu’
2 CONC l Jamal bin Dato’ Bendahara ‘Abdu’l Majid, Dato’Bendahara Sri Maharaja, of Pahang. Shed. in Siak, before 1741, having had issue, an only daughter by her first husband.
