2 CONT Sultan Abdul Fatah held 2 royal positions / titles simultaneously (at the same time), which gave him 2 different official names: as the Raja Alam of Pagaruyung he's known as Daulat Yang Dipertuan Sultan Alam Muningsyah II (the Sec
2 CONC ond) and as the Raja Adat of Pagaruyung he's known as Daulat Yang Dipertuan Sultan Abdul Jalil I (the First).
