2 CONT 1745 - 1777 H.H. Paduka Sri Daing Kamboja bin Opu Daing Parani, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau. b. at Siantan, 1697, son of Opu Daing Parani, by his first wife, Encik Fatima binti 'Abdu'l Malik, educ. privately. Named Kamboja in hon
2 CONC our of his father's recent expedition to Cambodia. Succeeded as Viceroy (Yang di-Pertuan Muda) on the death of his uncle, 19th May 1745. Installed by the Sultan of Johor, 11th March 1748. m. (first) Y.M. Raja Fatima binti al-Marhu
2 CONC m Sultan 'Ala ud-din Shah, Tun Encik Ayu, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan 'Ala ud-din Shah bin Daing Rilaga, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau, by his wife Y.M. Tun Encik binti Dato' Bendahara Tun 'Abdu'l Jamal, Ungku Encik Ayu, dau
2 CONC ghter of Y.M. Tun 'Abdu'l Jamal bin Dato' Bendahara 'Abdu'l Majid, Dato' Bendahara Sri Maharaja. m. (second) Daing Uteh, Engku Tua. m. (third) a Riau lady. He d. 30th June 1777, having had issue, five sons and four daughters
