2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 1763 - 1795 Paduka Sri Sultan Long Yunus ibni al-Marhum Sultan Long Sulaiman, Raja and Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Kelantan, younger son of Paduka Sri Sultan Long Sulaiman ibni al-Marhum Sultan Long Bahar, Raja of Kelantan. Expelled L
2 CONC ong Muhammad and became Raja of Kelantan at Fort Kubang Labu, before 12th July 1763. Became Raja and Yang di-Pertuan of Kelantan, 1776. Installed as Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Kelantan by his father-in-law Sultan Mansur Shah I of Tre
2 CONC ngganu, 1793. m. (first) before 1741, Tuan Encik Jumat, Inche' Puan Balai Dua, daughter of Engku Tanang Wangsa, of Trengganu, by his wife, Che' Milah, daughter of Kanda Abu. m. (second) ca. 1793, Inche' Encik Tuan Nawi, seventh da
2 CONC ughter of H.H. Sultan Mansur Shah I ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu. He d. 15th July 1795 (bur. Royal Cemetery, Kampung Langgar, Kota Bahru)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: Kelant4
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
