2 CONC I ibni al-Marhum Sultan Mansur, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu, by his first wife, Che’ Wan Zainab, Che’ Puan Besar, educ. privately. Appointed as Deputy ruler with the title of Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Muda, befo
