2 CONC  Tengku Muhammad, Tengku Ampuan Besar (b. 1787; m. second, 1831, H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku Sultan Mansur Shah II ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Trengganu, and d. 17th August 1864) - see below
2 CONC ), daughter of H.H. Tengku Muhammad ibni al-Marhum Sultan Mansur, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Kelantan, by his wife, Cik Ku Wan Teh, Che Puan Kelantan, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Long Yunus ibni al-Marhum Raja Long Sulaiman, R
