1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2) Y.M. Sri Paduka Tun Muhammad bin Dato' Bendahara Paduka Raja Tun 'Abdu'l Majid [Engku Sentul], Dato' Bendahara Sri Maharaja (cre. 1802), educ. privately. Settled at Chenor, then removed to Riau in 1802. m. a dau
2 CONC ghter of the Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau. He d. (drowned) at sea together with one of his wives, when his boat capsized in a storm between Pulau Tioman and Endau, 1803, having had issue, a son and a daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: [https://www.royalark.net/Malaysia/pahang4.htm]
