1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yamtuan Besar Raja Antah of Seri Menanti (Lord of Sri Menanti, Negri Sembilan) 1872 -1888
2 CONT
2 CONT His Royal Highness ruling territorial was confined to Seri Menanti, Johol, Inas, Ulu Muar, Jempol, Terachi & Gunung Pasir after the historic civil war called Battle of Mount Putus in 1874 when his warriors led by Dato Siamang Gaga
2 CONC p Hj Mukmin were defeated by Dato Kelana Putera Syed Abd Rahman (Syed Aman)'s men who was then backed by the British soldiers. That led to Sungai Ujung, Jelebu & Rembau being ruled by their respective Undangs during HRH reign as Y
2 CONC am Tuan of Seri Menanti.
