1 NAME Raja [Haji] Abdullah ibni /[alMarhum] Sultan Ja'afar Alauddin Shah/
2 GIVN Raja [Haji] Abdullah ibni
2 _MARNM [alMarhum] Sultan Ja'afar Alauddin Shah
1 NAME Raja [Haji] Abdullah (Yang DiPertuan Muda Riau ke9: 1857-8)
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Penyengat Island
2 ADDR
3 STAE Riau Islands
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 SEP 1858
2 PLAC Penyengat Island
2 ADDR
3 STAE Riau Islands
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 TITL [Paduka Sri Raja]
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1857 - 1858 H.H. Paduka Sri Raja Haji 'Abdu'llah ibni al-Marhum Sultan Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau, third son of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah ibni al-Marhum Raja Haji, 
2 CONC Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau, by his second wife, Y.M. Raja Saleha binti al-Marhum Sultan 'Ali 'Ala ud-din Shah, Tengku Lebar. Proclaimed as Viceroy (Yang di-Pertuan Muda) in succession to his elder half-brother, by the Dutch auth
2 CONC orities, at Tanjong Pinang, 9th October 1857. Leader of the Nakshahbandiyyah Mystic Order. m. (first) after April 1827, H.H. Raja Lijah binti al-Marhum Sultan Muhammad Shah, Tengku Ampuan, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Muhamm
2 CONC ad Shah ibni al-Marhum Ibrahim, Sultan of Selangor. m. (second) at Lingga, December 1831, H.H. Tengku Tengah Aisha binti al-Marhum Sultan 'Abdu'l Rahman Mu'azzam Shah (d. 1840), second daughter H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan 'Abdu'l Rahma
2 CONC n I Mu'azzam Shah ibni al-Marhum Sultan Mahmud Shah Alam, Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan Besar of Lingga, Riau and its dependencies. m. (third) after the death of his second wife, Y.M. Raja Hawa bin Raja Ahmad, younger daughter of Y.M
2 CONC . Raja Haji Ahmad Hitam bin Raja Haji, Engku Haji Tua. m. (fourth) after 1838, Y.M. Raja Khalifa binti Raja Haji, daughter of Y.M. Raja Haji ibni al-Marhum Sultan Ibrahim, of Selangor. He d. at Penyengat Island, 6th September 1858
2 CONC  (bur. there), having had issue, ten sons and seven daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: [http://www.royalark.net/Indonesia/riau7.htm]
