1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raja_Ali_Haji WIKI-EN]'''<br/>
2 CONT '''[https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Haji_bin_Raja_Haji_Ahmad WIKI-ID]'''<br/>
2 CONT '''[http://www.rajaalihaji.com/id/index.php LINK]'''
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  Y.M. Raja 'Ali Haji bin Raja Haji Ahmad (s/o Encik Hamida). b. at Pulau Penyengat, 1809, educ. privately. Author of "Gurindam Dua Belas" (1847), "Kitab Pengetahuan Bahasa" (1851) "Muqaddimah fi intizam" (1857), "Silsilah Melayu d
2 CONC an Bugis" (1865), "Tuhfilat al-Nafis" (ca 1866), "Muqaddimah fi intizam" (1869), etc. Posthumously declared a National Hero of Indonesia, 10th November 2004. m. (first) "Sulung", a commoner. m. (second) 1829, Y.M. Raja Halima bint
2 CONC i al-Marhum al-Marhum Sultan Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah ibni al-Marhum Raja Haji, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau. m. (third) Y.M. Raja Sofia binti al-Marhum al-Marhum Sultan
2 CONC  Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah, daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Sultan Ja'afar 'Ala ud-din Shah ibni al-Marhum Raja Haji, Yang di-Pertuan Muda of Riau. He d. at Mecca, Arabia, 25th November 1882, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: Riau4
2 CONT
2 CONT Raja Haji Ali bin Raja Ahmad, born 1809, married (a), Raja Safiah binti al-Marhum Raja Ja'afar, married (b), Daeng Chahaya binti Daeng Manaroh, married (c), Che' Sulong, married (d), Tengku Nai binti Tun Sabtir, and had issue. He 
2 CONC died 1872.
