2 NOTE The photo is taken at a Durbar (meeting of the Malay Rulers of the Federated Malay States) in 1903. Centre is my paternal great-grandfather, Tuanku Muhammad Ibni Tuanku Antah, the father of Tuanku Abdul Rahman (Tuanku Abdul Rahman
3 CONC  married Dulcibella Campbell). To his right is Sir Frank Swettenham, British Resident-General. 
3 CONT The photo is from Wendy Khadijah Moore's book - "Malaysia - A Pictorial History 1400-2004" .
2 NOTE Fascinating picture. Who are they and when was this taken? On what occassion?
