2 FORM jpg
2 NOTE This photo was taken at the first Durbar (meeting) of the Malay Rulers of the Federated Malay States in 1897. I have identified some of the dignitaries, including my great-grandfather, Tuanku Muhammad Shah Ibni Tuanku Antah. To hi
3 CONC s left is Sultan Idris of Perak, and to his left is Sir Charles Mitchell, British High Commissioner. Others are Sultan Abdul Samad of Selangor, Sultan Ahmad Tajuddin of Pahang and Sir Frank Swettenham the British Resident-General.
2 NOTE Interesting group photo. Which year is this? Who is who of the Sultans?
