1 NOTE {geni:about_me} b) H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku Abbas ibni al-Marhum Yam Tuan Muda Tuanku Mahmud, Yang di-Pertuan Muda (s/o Tengku Neng). Contested the succession on the death of his brother in December 1881, but was overlooked by the C
2 CONC hief Minister and nobles. Granted the title of Tengku Besar before 15th January 1877, and prom. to Yang di-Pertuan Muda 10th April 1882. Rcvd: Cdr. of the Order of the Crown of Siam (x.4.1887). m. (first) Y.M. Tengku Cik Fatima bi
2 CONC nti al-Marhum Yang di-Pertuan Muda Tengku 'Abdu'llah [Tengku Cik Putri Pantai] (d. before 18th March 1904), daughter of H.H. Paduka Sri Tuanku 'Abdu'llah ibni al-Marhum Sultan 'Abdu'l-Rahman, Yang di-Pertuan Muda, by his second wi
2 CONC fe, Y.M. Tengku Ning binti Tengku Wuk Ismail, daughter of Y.B.M. Tengku Wuk Ismail, the Chief Minister. m. (second) Wan Hamida [Midah], Che Puan Muda (m. second, after 1890, …, by whom she had further issue), a commoner from Manir
2 CONC . He d. 8th November 1889 (bur. Royal Cemetery, Kuala Trengganu), having had issue, two sons and six daughters:
2 CONT
