3 CONT 5. A Short History of Trengganu. M. C. ff Sheppard. JMBRAS, Vol. 22, No. 3 (149)(June 1949), pp. 1-74
3 CONT 6. Forum - worldnavalships Website.
3 CONT 7. Foto H.M.S Scout - City of Vancouver Archives
