1 NAME Sultan Ahmad (Marhum Tengah)
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Makam Diraja 
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kota Bharu
3 STAE Kelantan
3 CTRY Malaysia
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 20 NOV 1831
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 MAR 1890
2 PLAC Istana Jahar
